      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "• Coonan Property present this beautifully presented three-bedroom home with generous south-west facing rear garden\n• Extending to over 90 sq. m, the well-proportioned accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, guest W.C., living room, kitchen/dining room, utility room, three bedrooms including a master ensuite, and family bathroom.\n• Generous south-west facing rear garden featuring a raised deck area, well-maintained lawn and excellent privacy, with mature trees providing an attractive backdrop.\n• Ideally positioned within the popular Straffan Wood development, just a short walk from Maynooth town centre and its excellent range of amenities, including schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and Maynooth University.\n• Excellent transport links with Maynooth Train Station providing direct rail services to Dublin city centre, regular bus services and convenient access to the M4 motorway.\n• An ideal choice for first-time buyers, investors or those trading down, offering walk-in condition and strong rental appeal in a highly sought-after location.\n\nGuide Price\n415,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Hallway 5.95m x 1.92m\nSemi-solid oak flooring ,coving, hanging pendant light and built-in storage closet.\n\nGuest W.C. 1m x 1.87m\nTiled floor with w.c., w.h.b. and extractor fan.\n\nLiving Room 3.43m x 5.07m\nSemi-solid oak flooring continues from the hallway, with coving and a TV point. A feature fireplace with gas fire insert is the focal point in the room, with a bay window fitted with Venetian blinds, curtains and curtain pole.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room 3.44m x 4.65m\nPorcelain tiled floor throughout, with fitted floor and wall units in a shaker-style kitchen and tiled splashback. Stainless steel sink, with the area fully plumbed. Appliances included in the sale include double oven, gas hob, extractor, fridge freezer and dishwasher. Double doors lead out to the garden and decked area.\n\nUtility Room 1.75m x 1.18m\nFully plumbed with porcelain tiled floor and fitted shelving, housing the washing machine, dryer and gas boiler, complete with an extractor fan. ( washing machine and dryer not included)\n\nLanding 1.95m x 2.8m\nLaminate flooring, access to the attic, and a shelved hotpress off the landing.\n\nMaster Bedroom 4.66m x 3.25m\nFitted wardrobes and laminate flooring, with two windows to the front of the house dressed in Venetian blinds, curtain poles and curtains. \n\nEnsuite 1.58m x 1.88m\nTiled floor and tiled shower enclosure with electric Triton shower, w.c., w.h.b., extractor fan and a fitted wall-mounted toiletries cabinet.\n\nBedroom 2 2.46m x 3.41m\nLaminate flooring with a fitted wardrobe, Venetian blinds, curtain pole, curtains and light shade. Positioned to the rear of the house, overlooking the garden.\n\nBedroom 3 2.11m x 3.08m\nFitted wardrobes and laminate wood flooring, complete with Venetian blinds, curtain pole and curtains. \n\nBathroom 2.63m x 1.7m\nTiled floor and tiled surround to the bath, complete with bath, w.c., w.h.b., extractor fan and window.\n\nGarden 12.2m x 6.24m\nWest-facing rear featuring a raised deck area, well-maintained lawn, timber shed and not overlooked. \n\nAdditional Information:\nGross internal floor area approx. 90.2 sq.m/970 sq.ft.\nBuilt in 2005\nWide double gated side entrance \nOutside tap\nOutside lights \n\nItems Included in sale:\nDouble oven, gas hob, extractor, fridge freezer, dishwasher, blinds and curtains. \n\nServices\nCondensing gas boiler (4-5 years old)\nGas fire central heating \n\nBER \nC\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W23 X4V8\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nMick Wright\n016286128\n\n \n"
      },
